Note that while there may be a solution in the rc file (I'm not quite
familiar enough with it to know), there is also the option of changing
these up in your terminal emulator.

NAO is just sending terminal color codes to your term, which then
chooses to display a particular color to you. How each terminal
interprets the color "red" is up to that terminal. There are term
programs that allow you to remap color schemes at the client level.

